---
// Ende der Galerie: Weg weiter zu den Noticias (gleicher Stil wie
// “Galería de eventos” auf der Startseite).
---

<section class="relative isolate pb-24 pt-4 sm:pb-32">
  <div class="reveal mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-3 px-6 text-center">
    <p class="font-hand text-2xl text-celeste sm:text-3xl">¿Qué estamos haciendo ahora?</p>
    <a
      href="/noticias"
      class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-arena px-7 py-3 font-display text-xl text-azul shadow-lg transition hover:brightness-95 sm:text-2xl"
    >
      Últimas noticias
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        class="h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2.4"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
